menuconfig LEARNING_DRIVERS
	bool "Learning drivers (local experiments)"
	help
	  Enable local learning drivers used for kernel debugging practice.
	  This menu is intended for iterative experiments (for example in
	  QEMU/i.MX6UL) and can be extended with more driver categories later.

